1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Bugungi videoda nima haqida? Yaponiyaning Jahon merosi obyektlari

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
1-qism: Nara shahridagi yangi Jahon merosi obyektlari

3
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:15,041
A, televizordagi yangiliklarni koʻrib turing

4
00:00:15,064 --> 00:00:17,630
Qanday yangiliklar?

5
00:00:17,653 --> 00:00:20,387
Nara haqidagi yangiliklar

6
00:00:20,410 --> 00:00:25,776
Asuka va Fujiwara yangi Jahon merosi roʻyxatiga kiritiladi

7
00:00:25,799 --> 00:00:27,735
Rostdanmi?

8
00:00:27,759 --> 00:00:30,559
Bu juda ajoyib!

9
00:00:30,582 --> 00:00:35,182
Ha, men juda xursandman

10
00:00:35,205 --> 00:00:40,038
Narada koʻp Jahon merosi obyektlari bor ekan, shundaymi?

11
00:00:40,061 --> 00:00:43,346
Hozir nechtasi bor?

12
00:00:43,370 --> 00:00:47,906
Hozir uchta bor

13
00:00:47,929 --> 00:00:49,963
Uchtami?

14
00:00:49,987 --> 00:00:51,801
Qayerlarda?

15
00:00:51,824 --> 00:00:55,258
Birinchisi – Horyu-ji ibodatxonasi

16
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:59,414
Yaponiyadagi eng qadimgi yogʻoch ibodatxona

17
00:00:59,438 --> 00:01:01,485
Shundaymi?

18
00:01:01,509 --> 00:01:04,942
Men ham televizorda koʻrganman

19
00:01:04,965 --> 00:01:09,622
Ikkinchisi – Todaiji ibodatxonasi va Nara shahri

20
00:01:09,646 --> 00:01:13,379
U yerda katta Budda haykali bor, shundaymi?

21
00:01:13,402 --> 00:01:17,936
Parkda koʻp bugʻular ham bor

22
00:01:17,959 --> 00:01:22,759
Ha. Uchinchisi – janubdagi Yoshino togʻlari

23
00:01:22,782 --> 00:01:24,916
Yoshinomi?

24
00:01:24,939 --> 00:01:28,578
Bahorda guli juda chiroyli boʻladi, shundaymi?

25
00:01:28,601 --> 00:01:31,268
Ha, shunday

26
00:01:31,291 --> 00:01:37,024
Endi Asuka va Fujiwara bilan toʻrtta boʻladi

27
00:01:37,047 --> 00:01:40,465
Yaponiyada eng koʻpmi?

28
00:01:40,489 --> 00:01:45,622
Ha, Nara haqiqatan ham maxsus joy

29
00:01:45,645 --> 00:01:47,378
Ha, rostdan ham

30
00:01:47,401 --> 00:01:50,858
Chunki u yerda koʻp qadimiy tarixiy joylar bor

31
00:01:50,882 --> 00:01:55,515
Asuka Yaponiyadagi birinchi katta shahar boʻlgan

32
00:01:55,538 --> 00:01:59,636
Asukada hozir nima bor?

33
00:01:59,659 --> 00:02:03,510
Juda qadimiy ibodatxonalar va qabrlar bor

34
00:02:03,534 --> 00:02:05,872
Koʻfunmi?

35
00:02:05,895 --> 00:02:07,946
Bu nima?

36
00:02:07,969 --> 00:02:12,569
Qadimiy podsholar va buyuk odamlarning qabrlari

37
00:02:12,592 --> 00:02:15,886
Vay, qiziqarli ekan!

38
00:02:15,910 --> 00:02:18,244
Qanday shaklda?

39
00:02:18,267 --> 00:02:22,351
Juda katta toshlardan qurilgan

40
00:02:22,374 --> 00:02:26,431
Ichiga kirish mumkinmi?

41
00:02:26,455 --> 00:02:31,889
Yoʻq, lekin yaqinida devor rasmlarini koʻrish mumkin

42
00:02:31,913 --> 00:02:35,368
Men u rasmlarni koʻrishni juda xohlayman

43
00:02:35,391 --> 00:02:39,726
Shunday boʻlsa, shu hafta oxirida birga boramizmi?

44
00:02:39,750 --> 00:02:41,950
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

45
00:02:41,973 --> 00:02:44,181
Albatta boraylik!

46
00:02:44,204 --> 00:02:47,771
Osakadan elektr poyezdda boramizmi?

47
00:02:47,794 --> 00:02:51,327
Ha, Kintetsu elektr poyezdida boramiz

48
00:02:51,350 --> 00:02:56,717
Asuka katta joy, shuning uchun stansiyada velosiped ijaraga olamiz

49
00:02:56,740 --> 00:02:58,706
Tushunarli

50
00:02:58,729 --> 00:03:01,898
U yerda mazali ovqatlar taklif qiladigan restoranlar ham bormi?

51
00:03:01,922 --> 00:03:07,088
Ha, Nara mashhur xurmo bargi sushisini yeyishni taklif qilaman.

52
00:03:07,111 --> 00:03:11,160
Dam olish kunidagi sayohatimizni juda kutmoqdaman.

53
00:03:11,184 --> 00:03:20,193
Bugungi videoning ssenariysi tavsif va eng yaxshi kommentariydan yuklab olish mumkin. Yuklab olishdan oldin iltimos, izoh qoldiring.

54
00:03:20,193 --> 00:03:21,693
Sahna 2: Nara sayohati: Todai-ji ibodatxonasi / Nara sayohati: Todai-ji ibodatxonasiga tashrif

55
00:03:21,693 --> 00:03:24,526
Naraga yetib keldik-ku!

56
00:03:24,549 --> 00:03:27,916
Ha, ob-havo juda yaxshi.

57
00:03:27,939 --> 00:03:31,272
Avval qayerga boramiz?

58
00:03:31,295 --> 00:03:34,332
Todai-ji ibodatxonasiga boring.

59
00:03:34,356 --> 00:03:36,806
Piyoda boramizmi?

60
00:03:36,829 --> 00:03:38,429
Ha.

61
00:03:38,452 --> 00:03:42,827
Vokzaldan piyoda 15 daqiqa chamasi bor.

62
00:03:42,851 --> 00:03:44,851
Tushunarli

63
00:03:44,874 --> 00:03:46,685
Boraylik!

64
00:03:46,709 --> 00:03:49,384
Odamlar juda ko'p ekan-ku.

65
00:03:49,407 --> 00:03:51,141
Ha, rostdan ham

66
00:03:51,164 --> 00:03:54,170
Chet elliklar ham ko'p.

67
00:03:54,193 --> 00:03:57,160
Ana u yerda Todai-ji ibodatxonasi.

68
00:03:57,183 --> 00:04:01,616
Vov, bino juda katta ekan-ku!

69
00:04:01,639 --> 00:04:05,119
Ha, ichkariga kiramiz.

70
00:04:05,143 --> 00:04:08,076
Men chiptalarni sotib olaman.

71
00:04:08,099 --> 00:04:10,102
Rahmat.

72
00:04:10,125 --> 00:04:13,959
Qarang, Budda haykali!

73
00:04:13,982 --> 00:04:17,915
Vov, haqiqatan ham katta ekan!

74
00:04:17,938 --> 00:04:21,871
Ha, juda baland.

75
00:04:21,894 --> 00:04:24,970
15 metr atrofida bo'lishi kerak.

76
00:04:24,994 --> 00:04:27,204
Ajoyib!

77
00:04:27,227 --> 00:04:29,806
Rasmga tushamizmi?

78
00:04:29,830 --> 00:04:32,398
Ha, tushamiz.

79
00:04:32,421 --> 00:04:35,105
Tabassum qiling!

80
00:04:35,129 --> 00:04:37,129
Rahmat.

81
00:04:37,152 --> 00:04:41,442
Keyinroq bog'da sayr qilamiz.

82
00:04:41,465 --> 00:04:43,907
Ha, yaxshi fikr.

83
00:04:43,930 --> 00:04:46,419
Ana u yerga qarang!

84
00:04:46,443 --> 00:04:51,576
Vov, bog'da bug'ular juda ko'p ekan-ku!

85
00:04:51,599 --> 00:04:53,895
Juda yoqimtoy!

86
00:04:53,919 --> 00:04:57,492
Bug'ularga ovqat berishni xohlayman.

87
00:04:57,516 --> 00:05:01,360
Unda, bug'u pechenyelarini sotib olamiz.

88
00:05:01,383 --> 00:05:03,717
Bug'u pechenyelari deb?

89
00:05:03,739 --> 00:05:08,078
Ha, bug'ular uchun maxsus shirinlik.

90
00:05:08,102 --> 00:05:10,568
Bittasini sotib oldim.

91
00:05:10,591 --> 00:05:12,958
Bug'ular keldi-ku!

92
00:05:12,981 --> 00:05:17,049
Ha, iltimos, pechenye bering.

93
00:05:17,073 --> 00:05:19,473
Yaxshi yeydilar-ku.

94
00:05:19,496 --> 00:05:22,463
Juda yoqimtoy!

95
00:05:22,486 --> 00:05:25,784
Bug'ularga yana pechenye beramizmi?

96
00:05:25,808 --> 00:05:29,075
Ha, yana bittasini sotib olaman.

97
00:05:29,098 --> 00:05:32,031
Bug'ular ham xursand ko'rinishadi-ku.

98
00:05:32,054 --> 00:05:35,790
Naradagi sayohatimiz juda qiziqarli bo'ldi.

99
00:05:35,813 --> 00:05:38,413
Bu juda yaxshi.

100
00:05:38,436 --> 00:05:45,541
Bugungi videoni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasini tavsif va eng yaxshi kommentariyda topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan o'chirilishi mumkin.

101
00:05:45,541 --> 00:05:47,041
Sahna 3: Horyu-ji ibodatxonasi: Dunyodagi eng qadimgi yog'och inshoot / Horyu-ji ibodatxonasi: Dunyodagi eng qadimiy yog'och bino

102
00:05:47,041 --> 00:05:50,658
Horyu-ji ibodatxonasiga yetib keldik-ku!

103
00:05:50,681 --> 00:05:53,926
Juda tinch ekan.

104
00:05:53,950 --> 00:05:59,317
Ha. Koʻp eski binolar bor.

105
00:05:59,340 --> 00:06:03,793
Bu ibodatxona qachon qurilgan?

106
00:06:03,817 --> 00:06:07,017
Asuka davrida.

107
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:09,720
Juda qadimiy ekan.

108
00:06:09,743 --> 00:06:15,143
Shundaymi? Juda eski ekan.

109
00:06:15,166 --> 00:06:21,900
Ha. Yaponiyadagi yogʻoch binolar orasida eng qadimiysi.

110
00:06:21,923 --> 00:06:26,356
Yaponiyada eng qadimiysi ekanmi?

111
00:06:26,379 --> 00:06:31,984
Ha. Dunyodagi eng qadimgi yogʻoch bino ham aynan shu.

112
00:06:32,008 --> 00:06:37,894
Dunyoda eng qadimiysi ekanmi? Bu ajoyib!

113
00:06:37,918 --> 00:06:43,051
Ha. Shuning uchun ham Jahon merosi roʻyxatiga kiritilgan.

114
00:06:43,074 --> 00:06:46,413
Binoning ichiga kiramiz.

115
00:06:46,437 --> 00:06:50,651
Ha. Ana u yerda kirish joyi.

116
00:06:50,674 --> 00:06:53,007
Chiptalarni sotib oldim.

117
00:06:53,030 --> 00:06:54,797
Boraylik!

118
00:06:54,820 --> 00:07:01,440
Qarang. Ana u bino besh qavatli pagoda.

119
00:07:01,463 --> 00:07:05,996
Juda baland ekan. Chiroyli.

120
00:07:06,019 --> 00:07:10,157
Ha. Juda goʻzal.

121
00:07:10,181 --> 00:07:13,756
Bu yerda rasmga tushsam boʻladi mi?

122
00:07:13,779 --> 00:07:17,512
Tashqarida rasmga tushishingiz mumkin.

123
00:07:17,535 --> 00:07:21,302
Yaxshi. Birga tushamiz.

124
00:07:21,325 --> 00:07:25,599
Ha. Men kamerani ushlab turaman.

125
00:07:25,622 --> 00:07:27,389
Rahmat.

126
00:07:27,412 --> 00:07:33,312
Boshladik! Cheese!

127
00:07:33,335 --> 00:07:36,968
Yaxshi rasm chiqdi. Xursandman.

128
00:07:36,991 --> 00:07:41,391
Keyin ana u yerda joylashgan binoni koʻramiz.

129
00:07:41,414 --> 00:07:45,666
Ha. Uning ichida nima bor?

130
00:07:45,690 --> 00:07:48,566
Eski budda haykallari bor.

131
00:07:48,589 --> 00:07:52,272
Budda haykallarining rasmini olsam boʻladi mi?

132
00:07:52,296 --> 00:07:58,029
Yoʻq, binoning ichida rasmga tushish taqiqlanadi.

133
00:07:58,052 --> 00:08:01,734
Tushunarli. Ehtiyot boʻlaman.

134
00:08:01,758 --> 00:08:03,892
Sekin-asta koʻramiz.

135
00:08:03,915 --> 00:08:09,281
Bu budda haykali juda mehribon yuzli ekan.

136
00:08:09,304 --> 00:08:13,438
Ha. Men ham shunday deb oʻylayman.

137
00:08:13,461 --> 00:08:17,394
Horyu-ji ajoyib joy ekan.

138
00:08:17,417 --> 00:08:19,750
Kelganimiz yaxshi boʻldi.

139
00:08:19,773 --> 00:08:23,907
Ha. Tarixdan koʻp narsa oʻrgandim.

140
00:08:23,930 --> 00:08:28,302
Keyin sovgʻalar koʻrishga boramizmi?

141
00:08:28,325 --> 00:08:31,692
Yaxshi. Boramiz.

142
00:08:31,715 --> 00:08:33,215
4-sahna: Shinkansendan koʻrinadigan Fudzi togʻi

143
00:08:33,215 --> 00:08:36,548
Shinkansen juda tez ekan.

144
00:08:36,571 --> 00:08:40,012
Ha. Juda tez.

145
00:08:40,036 --> 00:08:42,503
A, qarang!

146
00:08:42,526 --> 00:08:46,221
Derazadan katta togʻ koʻrinib turibdi.

147
00:08:46,244 --> 00:08:48,244
Rostdan ham.

148
00:08:48,267 --> 00:08:51,338
U Fudzi togʻimi?

149
00:08:51,362 --> 00:08:54,129
Ha, shunday

150
00:08:54,152 --> 00:08:57,728
Yaponiyadagi eng mashhur togʻ.

151
00:08:57,751 --> 00:09:00,996
Vov, juda chiroyli!

152
00:09:01,020 --> 00:09:03,698
Bugun ob-havo yaxshi.

153
00:09:03,721 --> 00:09:06,921
Shuning uchun yaxshi koʻrinib turibdi.

154
00:09:06,944 --> 00:09:10,078
Togʻning yuqori qismi oq ekan.

155
00:09:10,101 --> 00:09:13,581
Ha. Qor borligi uchun.

156
00:09:13,604 --> 00:09:17,604
Men Fudzi togʻining rasmini olmoqchiman.

157
00:09:17,627 --> 00:09:19,260
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

158
00:09:19,283 --> 00:09:21,898
Ha, suratga oldim.

159
00:09:21,922 --> 00:09:24,098
Juda chiroyli surat ekan!

160
00:09:24,122 --> 00:09:28,659
Fudzi togʻi Yaponiyadagi eng baland togʻdir.

161
00:09:28,682 --> 00:09:31,148
Qancha baland?

162
00:09:31,171 --> 00:09:34,505
Taxminan 3700 metr.

163
00:09:34,528 --> 00:09:37,012
Juda baland ekan!

164
00:09:37,035 --> 00:09:39,924
Unga chiqish mumkinmi?

165
00:09:39,948 --> 00:09:44,187
Ha. Yozda koʻp odamlar chiqadi.

166
00:09:44,210 --> 00:09:49,377
Shundaymi? Men ham bir kun chiqmoqchiman.

167
00:09:49,400 --> 00:09:51,833
Fudzi togʻiga chiqmoqchimisiz?

168
00:09:51,856 --> 00:09:55,943
Ha. Eng tepasigacha borishni istayman.

169
00:09:55,966 --> 00:10:00,065
Tepasidan koʻrinadigan manzara juda goʻzal.

170
00:10:00,088 --> 00:10:02,337
Tezroq koʻrmoqchiman.

171
00:10:02,361 --> 00:10:05,330
Albatta, yaxshi xotira boʻladi.

172
00:10:05,354 --> 00:10:08,836
Ammo chiqish qiyinmi?

173
00:10:08,859 --> 00:10:14,225
Ha. Koʻp yurish kerak boʻladi, juda charchaysiz.

174
00:10:14,248 --> 00:10:18,015
Unda koʻp mashq qilish kerak.

175
00:10:18,038 --> 00:10:22,608
Ha. Togʻ poyabzali ham muhim.

176
00:10:22,631 --> 00:10:26,231
Men togʻ poyabzali sotib olmoqchiman.

177
00:10:26,254 --> 00:10:30,458
Yaxshi. Birga borib sotib olamiz.

178
00:10:30,482 --> 00:10:32,082
Rahmat.

179
00:10:32,105 --> 00:10:36,959
Fudzi togʻi yaqinida goʻzal koʻllar ham bor.

180
00:10:36,983 --> 00:10:39,075
Koʻlmi?

181
00:10:39,099 --> 00:10:43,665
Ha. U yerdan koʻrinadigan Fudzi togʻi ham goʻzal.

182
00:10:43,688 --> 00:10:47,122
Unda koʻlga ham borishni istayman.

183
00:10:47,145 --> 00:10:50,811
Keyingi safar u yerga boramiz.

184
00:10:50,834 --> 00:10:54,168
Ha. Juda kutaman.

185
00:10:54,191 --> 00:10:55,691
5-Sahna: Kinkaku-ji ibodatxonasiga boring / Kinkaku-jiga tashrif buyuramiz

186
00:10:55,691 --> 00:10:58,630
Kyotoga yetib keldik-ku!

187
00:10:58,653 --> 00:11:01,920
Ha. Poyezdda tez yetib keldik.

188
00:11:01,943 --> 00:11:05,743
Bu yerda ham koʻp odamlar bor ekan.

189
00:11:05,766 --> 00:11:08,333
Juda gavjum joy ekan.

190
00:11:08,356 --> 00:11:11,189
Endi qayerga boramiz?

191
00:11:11,212 --> 00:11:13,979
Kinkaku-jiga boring.

192
00:11:14,002 --> 00:11:16,403
Kinkaku-ji deb?

193
00:11:16,426 --> 00:11:18,865
Qanday ibodatxona bu?

194
00:11:18,888 --> 00:11:22,855
Oltin rangli juda chiroyli ibodatxona.

195
00:11:22,878 --> 00:11:25,211
Oltin rangdami?

196
00:11:25,234 --> 00:11:27,887
Bu juda ajoyib!

197
00:11:27,911 --> 00:11:31,278
Ha. Avtobusda boramiz.

198
00:11:31,301 --> 00:11:34,787
Avtobusda qancha vaqt ketadi?

199
00:11:34,810 --> 00:11:37,589
Taxminan 30 daqiqa.

200
00:11:37,613 --> 00:11:39,646
Tushunarli

201
00:11:39,669 --> 00:11:42,236
Kinkaku-jiga yetib keldik!

202
00:11:42,259 --> 00:11:44,459
Ichkariga kiramiz.

203
00:11:44,481 --> 00:11:46,885
Chiptalarni sotib olamiz.

204
00:11:46,909 --> 00:11:48,548
Rahmat.

205
00:11:48,571 --> 00:11:50,654
Qarang!

206
00:11:50,678 --> 00:11:53,745
U yerda bino bor.

207
00:11:53,768 --> 00:11:58,102
Vaa, haqiqatan ham oltin rangda ekan!

208
00:11:58,125 --> 00:12:01,599
Ha. Juda chiroyli.

209
00:12:01,622 --> 00:12:04,989
Suv ichida ham ibodatxona koʻrinib turibdi.

210
00:12:05,012 --> 00:12:07,869
Katta hovuz bor, shuning uchun.

211
00:12:07,892 --> 00:12:11,226
Bu yerda suratga tushamiz.

212
00:12:11,249 --> 00:12:14,496
Ha, men suratga olaman.

213
00:12:14,520 --> 00:12:16,093
Iltimos.

214
00:12:16,116 --> 00:12:19,567
Kinkaku-ji atrofidagi manzara ham juda chiroyli.

215
00:12:19,590 --> 00:12:22,223
Daraxtlar juda ko'p ekan, shundaymi?

216
00:12:22,246 --> 00:12:24,380
Sayr qilaylik.

217
00:12:24,403 --> 00:12:27,500
U yerda suvenirlar do'koni bor.

218
00:12:27,523 --> 00:12:29,594
Borib ko'raylik.

219
00:12:29,618 --> 00:12:31,818
Nima sotib olmoqchisiz?

220
00:12:31,841 --> 00:12:35,218
Men shirinlik sotib olmoqchiman.

221
00:12:35,241 --> 00:12:38,208
Kioto shirinliklari juda mazali ekan.

222
00:12:38,231 --> 00:12:40,900
Matcha pechenyelari bor.

223
00:12:40,924 --> 00:12:42,924
Juda mazali ko'rinadi.

224
00:12:42,947 --> 00:12:45,818
Do'stlarim uchun shuni sotib olaman.

225
00:12:45,842 --> 00:12:48,875
Men choy sotib olmoqchiman.

226
00:12:48,898 --> 00:12:50,468
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

227
00:12:50,492 --> 00:12:54,059
Bugun kechqurun mehmonxonada birga choy ichamiz.

228
00:12:54,082 --> 00:12:56,940
Ha, juda kutaman.

229
00:12:56,963 --> 00:12:58,463
6-Sahna: Miyajima sayohati va Itsukushima ibodatxonasi / Miyajima sayohati va Itsukushima ziyoratgohi

230
00:12:58,463 --> 00:13:01,630
Xiroshimaga yetib keldik-ku.

231
00:13:01,653 --> 00:13:04,393
Endi qayerga boramiz?

232
00:13:04,416 --> 00:13:07,869
Parom bekati tomon boramiz.

233
00:13:07,892 --> 00:13:11,359
Miyajimagacha paromda boramiz.

234
00:13:11,382 --> 00:13:14,188
Qancha vaqt ketadi?

235
00:13:14,212 --> 00:13:16,145
Uzoqmi?

236
00:13:16,168 --> 00:13:19,218
15 daqiqa atrofida.

237
00:13:19,242 --> 00:13:22,842
Yaqin joy, tez yetib boramiz.

238
00:13:22,865 --> 00:13:26,198
Kema minish juda qiziqarli ekan.

239
00:13:26,221 --> 00:13:29,589
Dengiz shamoli juda yoqimli.

240
00:13:29,613 --> 00:13:32,946
Ha, bugun ob-havo juda yaxshi ekan.

241
00:13:32,969 --> 00:13:36,169
A, qarang!

242
00:13:36,192 --> 00:13:40,826
Dengiz ichida katta qizil narsa bor.

243
00:13:40,849 --> 00:13:43,849
U — torii (ibodatxona darvozasi).

244
00:13:43,872 --> 00:13:47,605
Itsukushima ziyoratgohining torii darvozasi.

245
00:13:47,628 --> 00:13:50,037
Torii darvozasi deb ataladi, shundaymi?

246
00:13:50,061 --> 00:13:53,907
Ziyoratchi ham dengiz ichida joylashganmi?

247
00:13:53,930 --> 00:13:55,864
Ha.

248
00:13:55,887 --> 00:13:59,620
U ziyoratgoh dengiz ichida joylashgan.

249
00:13:59,643 --> 00:14:02,695
Bu juda ajoyib ekan.

250
00:14:02,718 --> 00:14:06,052
Ichiga qanday kiriladi?

251
00:14:06,074 --> 00:14:14,085
Ziyoratchi binolari ham dengiz ustida joylashgan, shuning uchun ko'prikdan piyoda kiriladi.

252
00:14:14,109 --> 00:14:17,206
Torii darvozasiga yaqin borish mumkinmi?

253
00:14:17,230 --> 00:14:21,263
Hozir dengiz ichida, borish mumkin emas.

254
00:14:21,286 --> 00:14:25,983
Ammo kechqurun piyoda borish mumkin.

255
00:14:26,007 --> 00:14:29,880
Piyoda borish mumkinmi?

256
00:14:29,903 --> 00:14:31,970
Nega?

257
00:14:31,993 --> 00:14:36,531
Kechqurun dengiz suvi kamayadi.

258
00:14:36,555 --> 00:14:40,053
Shuning uchun piyoda borish mumkin.

259
00:14:40,076 --> 00:14:43,486
Bu juda ajoyib!

260
00:14:43,510 --> 00:14:47,723
Kechqurun yaqinroqqa piyoda boramiz.

261
00:14:47,746 --> 00:14:50,325
Ha, boramiz.

262
00:14:50,349 --> 00:14:54,244
A, Miyajimaga yetib keldik.

263
00:14:54,267 --> 00:14:57,403
Odamlar juda ko'p ekan-ku.

264
00:14:57,427 --> 00:15:01,040
A, bu yerda ham bug'ular bor.

265
00:15:01,063 --> 00:15:03,270
Rostdan ham.

266
00:15:03,293 --> 00:15:07,027
Naradagi kabi ko'p bug'ular bor.

267
00:15:07,050 --> 00:15:10,549
Bug'ularga senbey berishni xohlayman.

268
00:15:10,572 --> 00:15:12,645
Sotib olish mumkinmi?

269
00:15:12,669 --> 00:15:18,546
Bu yerda bugʻularga ovqat berish taqiqlanadi.

270
00:15:18,569 --> 00:15:20,069
7-Sahna: Himeji qal’asi va Oq qush qal’asi / Himeji qal’asi va Shirasagi qal’asi

271
00:15:20,069 --> 00:15:23,349
Himejiga yetib keldik.

272
00:15:23,372 --> 00:15:26,938
Ana u Himeji qal’asi ekan.

273
00:15:26,961 --> 00:15:31,233
Vov, juda katta qal’a ekan!

274
00:15:31,257 --> 00:15:34,947
Va juda oq ham.

275
00:15:34,970 --> 00:15:39,063
Ha. Oq va chiroyli.

276
00:15:39,087 --> 00:15:43,620
Bu qal’aning maxsus nomi bor.

277
00:15:43,643 --> 00:15:46,876
Maxsus nomi deb?

278
00:15:46,899 --> 00:15:48,699
Nima desalar?

279
00:15:48,722 --> 00:15:52,008
Oq qush qal’asi deyiladi.

280
00:15:52,032 --> 00:15:54,710
Oq qushmi?

281
00:15:54,733 --> 00:15:57,169
Bu nima?

282
00:15:57,193 --> 00:16:00,860
Oq qushning nomi.

283
00:16:00,883 --> 00:16:03,899
Oq qush qal’asi ekanmi?

284
00:16:03,922 --> 00:16:06,489
Chiroyli nom ekan-ku!

285
00:16:06,512 --> 00:16:10,845
Endi, qal’aning ichiga kiramiz.

286
00:16:10,868 --> 00:16:13,725
Ha, boramiz!

287
00:16:13,749 --> 00:16:17,316
Bu yerda poyabzalingizni echib qoʻying.

288
00:16:17,339 --> 00:16:19,272
Tushunarli

289
00:16:19,295 --> 00:16:22,695
Bu yerdan yuqoriga chiqamiz.

290
00:16:22,718 --> 00:16:26,537
Zina koʻp ekan-ku!

291
00:16:26,560 --> 00:16:30,760
Ha, ehtiyot boʻling.

292
00:16:30,783 --> 00:16:32,633
Rahmat.

293
00:16:32,657 --> 00:16:36,190
Hali yuqorisi bor ekan-ku.

294
00:16:36,213 --> 00:16:40,180
Uf, biroz charchadim.

295
00:16:40,203 --> 00:16:42,446
Yaxshimisiz?

296
00:16:42,469 --> 00:16:47,103
Ha. Lekin zinapoya uzun ekan.

297
00:16:47,126 --> 00:16:53,092
Qadimiy bino boʻlsa kerak. Lift yoʻq.

298
00:16:53,115 --> 00:16:57,315
Shunday. Sekin-sekin chiqamiz.

299
00:16:57,338 --> 00:17:02,272
Endi biroz qoldi, eng yuqorisi.

300
00:17:02,295 --> 00:17:04,108
Janob, davom etamiz!

301
00:17:04,131 --> 00:17:06,221
Yetib keldik.

302
00:17:06,245 --> 00:17:09,521
Bu eng yuqori qismi.

303
00:17:09,545 --> 00:17:12,145
Tashqariga qarang.

304
00:17:12,168 --> 00:17:15,340
Juda goʻzal manzara ekan!

305
00:17:15,363 --> 00:17:20,096
Himeji shahri butunlay koʻrinib turibdi.

306
00:17:20,119 --> 00:17:23,553
Shamol ham yoqimli esayapti.

307
00:17:23,576 --> 00:17:26,948
Hali charchadingizmi?

308
00:17:26,972 --> 00:17:32,629
Yoʻq, bu manzarani koʻrgach, yana quvvatlandim!

309
00:17:32,653 --> 00:17:36,058
Bu juda yaxshi.

310
00:17:36,081 --> 00:17:38,817
Bu yerda suratga tushamiz.

311
00:17:38,840 --> 00:17:40,929
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

312
00:17:40,953 --> 00:17:44,120
Derazaga yaqinroq turib turing.

313
00:17:44,143 --> 00:17:46,478
Ha, iltimos.

314
00:17:46,501 --> 00:17:48,710
Suratga olaman.

315
00:17:48,734 --> 00:17:52,135
Ha, „pishloq“!

316
00:17:52,159 --> 00:17:54,092
Rahmat.

317
00:17:54,115 --> 00:17:56,848
Juda chiroyli surat ekan!

318
00:17:56,871 --> 00:17:58,371
8-Sahna: Shirakawa-go va qoqilma uylar / Shirakawa-go va Gassho uslubidagi uylar

319
00:17:58,371 --> 00:18:02,005
Qaysi rasmga qarayapsiz?

320
00:18:02,028 --> 00:18:05,594
Gifu prefekturasidagi Shirakawa-goning rasmi.

321
00:18:05,617 --> 00:18:09,472
Vov, qor koʻp ekan-ku!

322
00:18:09,496 --> 00:18:14,462
Ha. Qishda qor juda koʻp yogʻadi.

323
00:18:14,485 --> 00:18:17,290
Juda chiroyli qishloq ekan!

324
00:18:17,314 --> 00:18:22,281
Ha. Bu ham Yaponiyaning Jahon merosi ob’ekti.

325
00:18:22,304 --> 00:18:25,737
Shirakawa-go qanday joy?

326
00:18:25,760 --> 00:18:29,760
Togʻlar orasidagi qadimiy qishloq.

327
00:18:29,783 --> 00:18:33,583
Uyning tomi juda katta ekan, shunday emasmi?

328
00:18:33,606 --> 00:18:38,292
Ha. Bu „Gasshō-zukuri“ deb ataladi.

329
00:18:38,315 --> 00:18:42,482
„Gasshō-zukuri“mi? Bu nima degani?

330
00:18:42,505 --> 00:18:45,372
Qoʻllarni birlashtirib ibodat qilgandek shaklda.

331
00:18:45,395 --> 00:18:47,761
Qiziqarli ekan!

332
00:18:47,784 --> 00:18:50,992
Nega aynan shunday shaklda?

333
00:18:51,016 --> 00:18:55,583
Qor koʻp yogʻadi, shuning uchun shunday shaklda.

334
00:18:55,606 --> 00:19:00,073
Tushunarli. Qor osongina tushib ketadi, shundaymi?

335
00:19:00,096 --> 00:19:03,929
Ha. Bu qadimiy odamlarning dono gʻoyalari.

336
00:19:03,952 --> 00:19:08,386
Bu uy kimlar qurgan?

337
00:19:08,409 --> 00:19:11,895
Qadim zamonlardagi odamlar birgalikda qurishgan.

338
00:19:11,918 --> 00:19:14,005
Ajoyib!

339
00:19:14,028 --> 00:19:16,994
Hozir ham odamlar yashaydimi?

340
00:19:17,017 --> 00:19:21,184
Ha. Koʻp odamlar bu yerda hayot kechirishadi.

341
00:19:21,207 --> 00:19:24,574
Uyning ichiga kirish mumkinmi?

342
00:19:24,597 --> 00:19:28,936
Ha. Ichiga kirish mumkin boʻlgan uylar ham bor.

343
00:19:28,960 --> 00:19:31,893
Ichida qanday tuygʻu hosil boʻladi?

344
00:19:31,916 --> 00:19:34,729
Qadimiy asbob-uskunalar bor.

345
00:19:34,753 --> 00:19:36,886
Juda keng ekan.

346
00:19:36,909 --> 00:19:39,717
Bu juda qiziqarli ekan!

347
00:19:39,741 --> 00:19:43,776
Qishda kechalari uylar yoritiladi.

348
00:19:43,799 --> 00:19:46,168
Yoritishmi?

349
00:19:46,192 --> 00:19:50,592
Ha. Uyning chiroqlari juda chiroyli boʻladi.

350
00:19:50,615 --> 00:19:52,949
Romantik ekan!

351
00:19:52,972 --> 00:19:56,055
Shu suratlari ham bormi?

352
00:19:56,078 --> 00:19:58,844
Qarang, mana bu surat.

353
00:19:58,867 --> 00:20:01,506
Rostdan ham juda chiroyli!

354
00:20:01,530 --> 00:20:04,297
Men ham borishni istayman.

355
00:20:04,320 --> 00:20:07,754
Unda bir kun birga boramiz.

356
00:20:07,777 --> 00:20:09,944
Qachon yaxshi boʻlardi?

357
00:20:09,967 --> 00:20:12,600
Qish faslida yaxshi boʻlardi.

358
00:20:12,623 --> 00:20:15,257
Lekin juda sovuq boʻladi-ku.

359
00:20:15,280 --> 00:20:18,752
Unda qanday kiyim kiyish kerak?

360
00:20:18,775 --> 00:20:22,671
Issiq palto va etik kerak boʻladi.

361
00:20:22,695 --> 00:20:24,301
Tushunarli

362
00:20:24,325 --> 00:20:27,491
Mazali taomlar bormi?

363
00:20:27,514 --> 00:20:30,181
Hida mol goʻshti juda mashhur.

364
00:20:30,205 --> 00:20:32,498
Mazali yapon mol goʻshti.

365
00:20:32,521 --> 00:20:34,293
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

366
00:20:34,317 --> 00:20:37,009
Tezroq borishni istayman!

367
00:20:37,032 --> 00:20:39,266
Kutish juda qiziqarli boʻladi!

368
00:20:39,289 --> 00:20:40,789
9-sahna: Yaku oroliga sayohat / Yaku orolini oʻrganish

369
00:20:40,789 --> 00:20:45,226
Keyin qayerga sayohat qilishni xohlaysiz?

370
00:20:45,249 --> 00:20:50,900
Men Kagoshima prefekturasidagi Yaku oroliga borishni xohlayman.

371
00:20:50,924 --> 00:20:53,291
Yaku orolimi?

372
00:20:53,314 --> 00:20:56,047
U yer qanday joy?

373
00:20:56,070 --> 00:21:00,803
Dengiz va togʻlari juda chiroyli orol.

374
00:21:00,826 --> 00:21:04,160
Bu ham Jahon merosi ob’ekti, shundaymi?

375
00:21:04,183 --> 00:21:09,183
Ha. Tabiati juda ajoyib.

376
00:21:09,206 --> 00:21:13,062
Siz Yaku oroliga borganmisiz?

377
00:21:13,085 --> 00:21:16,574
Yoʻq, hali borganim yoʻq.

378
00:21:16,597 --> 00:21:20,597
Shuning uchun bir kun borishni xohlayman.

379
00:21:20,620 --> 00:21:24,100
Yaku orolida nima bor?

380
00:21:24,124 --> 00:21:28,741
Juda qadim va katta daraxt bor.

381
00:21:28,764 --> 00:21:31,611
Katta daraxtmi?

382
00:21:31,635 --> 00:21:36,251
Ha. Bu mashhur sadr daraxti.

383
00:21:36,274 --> 00:21:39,074
Qancha qadimiyligini bilasiz?

384
00:21:39,097 --> 00:21:42,747
Ming yillar oldin oʻsgan daraxt.

385
00:21:42,770 --> 00:21:45,945
Bu juda ajoyib!

386
00:21:45,969 --> 00:21:49,176
Men ham koʻrmoqchiman.

387
00:21:49,200 --> 00:21:54,233
Ammo daraxtgacha koʻp yurish kerak boʻladi.

388
00:21:54,256 --> 00:21:56,789
Qancha yurish kerak?

389
00:21:56,812 --> 00:22:00,979
Togʻlarda taxminan 10 soat yurish kerak.

390
00:22:01,002 --> 00:22:04,813
E, 10 soatmi?

391
00:22:04,836 --> 00:22:07,870
Bu anchagina qiyin boʻladi-ku.

392
00:22:07,893 --> 00:22:13,326
Ha. Shuning uchun tayyorgarlik muhim.

393
00:22:13,349 --> 00:22:16,433
Qanday tayyorgarlik kerak?

394
00:22:16,456 --> 00:22:21,467
Avvalo, yurishga qulay poyabzal kerak.

395
00:22:21,490 --> 00:22:24,124
Togʻ poyabzali, shundaymi?

396
00:22:24,147 --> 00:22:26,480
Tushunarli

397
00:22:26,503 --> 00:22:30,382
Shuningdek, yomgʻirli kiyim ham kerak.

398
00:22:30,406 --> 00:22:32,872
Yomgʻirli palto, shundaymi?

399
00:22:32,895 --> 00:22:35,262
Nega?

400
00:22:35,285 --> 00:22:40,095
Yakushima juda koʻp yomgʻir yogʻadi.

401
00:22:40,118 --> 00:22:42,958
Koʻp yomgʻir yogʻadimi?

402
00:22:42,982 --> 00:22:50,037
Ha. Bir oyda 35 kun yomgʻir yogʻadi deyishadi.

403
00:22:50,061 --> 00:22:53,227
Bu juda qiziqarli ekan!

404
00:22:53,250 --> 00:22:56,227
Juda koʻp yogʻadi-ku.

405
00:22:56,251 --> 00:23:02,510
Soyabon qoʻlda ishlatilmaydi, togʻlarda xavfli boʻladi.

406
00:23:02,533 --> 00:23:04,100
Ha, rostdan ham

407
00:23:04,123 --> 00:23:07,856
Unda yomgʻirli kiyim sotib olaman.

408
00:23:07,879 --> 00:23:12,112
Dam olish kunida birga borib sotib olamiz.

409
00:23:12,135 --> 00:23:14,302
Rahmat.

410
00:23:14,325 --> 00:23:17,820
Qachondir birga boramiz.

411
00:23:17,843 --> 00:23:19,610
Ha.

412
00:23:19,633 --> 00:23:22,803
Hozirdan koʻp mashq qilaman.

413
00:23:22,827 --> 00:23:25,261
Kuch-quvvat bilan!

414
00:23:25,284 --> 00:23:26,784
10-Sahna: Jahon merosi Shiretokoning tabiati

415
00:23:26,784 --> 00:23:29,673
Televizorga qarang.

416
00:23:29,697 --> 00:23:33,772
Hozir Xokkaydo haqidagi koʻrsatuv ketmoqda.

417
00:23:33,796 --> 00:23:38,929
Vov, dengiz va togʻlar juda chiroyli ekan!

418
00:23:38,952 --> 00:23:43,352
Ha. Bu Shiretoko.

419
00:23:43,375 --> 00:23:46,775
Yaponiya Jahon merosi ob’ekti.

420
00:23:46,798 --> 00:23:49,131
Shiretokomi?

421
00:23:49,154 --> 00:23:52,688
Bu yerda tabiat juda koʻp.

422
00:23:52,711 --> 00:23:54,487
Ha.

423
00:23:54,510 --> 00:23:57,076
A, qarang!

424
00:23:57,099 --> 00:23:59,068
Ayiqlar bor.

425
00:23:59,092 --> 00:24:01,170
Rostdan ham.

426
00:24:01,194 --> 00:24:03,827
Juda kattalar.

427
00:24:03,850 --> 00:24:07,590
Ayiqlar daryodagi baliqlarni yeydi.

428
00:24:07,613 --> 00:24:10,909
Daryoda juda koʻp baliq bor ekan.

429
00:24:10,932 --> 00:24:12,665
Ha.

430
00:24:12,688 --> 00:24:15,865
Endi tulki paydo boʻldi.

431
00:24:15,889 --> 00:24:18,108
Qanchalik yoqimtoy!

432
00:24:18,131 --> 00:24:21,198
Tulkilar ham koʻpmi?

433
00:24:21,221 --> 00:24:22,821
Ha.

434
00:24:22,844 --> 00:24:25,711
Togʻlarda juda koʻp.

435
00:24:25,734 --> 00:24:28,903
Qushlar ham havoda uchmoqda.

436
00:24:28,926 --> 00:24:32,800
Shiretokoda juda koʻp hayvonlar bor.

437
00:24:32,823 --> 00:24:35,990
Bu yer juda ajoyib joy ekan-ku.

438
00:24:36,013 --> 00:24:41,246
Men hayvonlarni juda yaxshi koʻraman. Men ham.

439
00:24:41,269 --> 00:24:44,039
Qishki Shiretoko qanday?

440
00:24:44,063 --> 00:24:47,359
Qishda juda koʻp qor yogʻadi.

441
00:24:47,382 --> 00:24:50,149
Juda sovuq boʻladi.

442
00:24:50,172 --> 00:24:52,544
Dengizda nima bo‘ladi?

443
00:24:52,568 --> 00:24:56,622
Dengizga ko‘p oq muzlar keladi.

444
00:24:56,645 --> 00:24:59,279
Oq muzlarmi?

445
00:24:59,302 --> 00:25:01,272
Ha.

446
00:25:01,295 --> 00:25:04,030
Uzoq shimoliy dengizlardan keladi.

447
00:25:04,053 --> 00:25:06,488
Ajoyib!

448
00:25:06,512 --> 00:25:10,078
Muz ustida hayvonlar bormi?

449
00:25:10,101 --> 00:25:11,968
Ha.

450
00:25:11,991 --> 00:25:17,124
Muz ustida oq qushlar va tyulenlar bor.

451
00:25:17,147 --> 00:25:20,681
Kemadan bu muzlarni ko‘rish mumkinmi?

452
00:25:20,704 --> 00:25:22,353
Ha.

453
00:25:22,376 --> 00:25:26,450
Kemaga chiqib, muzga yaqin boramiz.

454
00:25:26,474 --> 00:25:29,341
Bu juda qiziqarli ko‘rinadi!

455
00:25:29,364 --> 00:25:32,617
Bu juda mashhur joy, bilasizmi?

456
00:25:32,640 --> 00:25:36,207
Men bir kun Shiretokoga borishni orzu qilaman.

457
00:25:36,230 --> 00:25:38,110
Yaxshi boʻlardi!

458
00:25:38,134 --> 00:25:41,471
U yerda juda mazali taomlar ham bor.

459
00:25:41,494 --> 00:25:43,788
Nima mazali?

460
00:25:43,811 --> 00:25:48,745
Dengiz baliqlari va qisqichbaqalari juda mazali.

461
00:25:48,768 --> 00:25:50,426
Yeyishni xohlardim!

462
00:25:50,449 --> 00:25:52,920
U yerga qanday borish mumkin?

463
00:25:52,944 --> 00:25:57,477
Tokiodan samolyotda Xokkaydoga borasiz.

464
00:25:57,500 --> 00:26:00,434
Keyin avtobusga chiqamizmi?

465
00:26:00,457 --> 00:26:02,072
Ha.

466
00:26:02,095 --> 00:26:05,065
Avtobusda Shiretokoga boramiz.

467
00:26:05,089 --> 00:26:07,455
Bir oz uzoq ekan.

468
00:26:07,478 --> 00:26:11,812
Uzoq bo‘lsa ham, bir kun albatta borishni xohlayman.

469
00:26:11,834 --> 00:26:14,568
Bir kun birga boramiz!

470
00:26:14,591 --> 00:26:16,157
Ha.

471
00:26:16,180 --> 00:26:20,314
Yaponiyaning Jahon merosi haqidagi darsimiz shu yerda tugadi.

472
00:26:20,337 --> 00:26:24,103
Ko‘p sayohat rejalarini tuzdik, shundaymi?

473
00:26:24,126 --> 00:26:27,693
Bir kun barcha joylarga borishni orzu qilaman!